cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RNA-seq Analysis Pipeline for Rpb4 Mutants in Saccharomyces cerevisiae"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-01-21
authors:
  - family-names: "Hannaoui Anaaoui"
    given-names: "Adil"
abstract: >-
  A complete RNA-seq analysis pipeline for studying transcriptional changes 
  in Saccharomyces cerevisiae strains carrying phospho-null and phospho-mimetic 
  mutations in the Rpb4 subunit of RNA polymerase II. The pipeline includes 
  quality control, read alignment, differential expression analysis, and 
  downstream statistical analysis using DESeq2 and GO enrichment. 
  Data generated at the Institute of Functional Biology and Genomics (IBFG).
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - Saccharomyces cerevisiae
  - Rpb4
  - RNA polymerase II
  - differential expression
  - DESeq2
  - bioinformatics
  - genomics
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AdilHannaoui/RNA-seq-Analysis"
url: "https://github.com/AdilHannaoui/RNA-seq-Analysis"
